  "id": "dynamic-segments",
  "title": "Path variables",
  "summary": "A route path can hold a path variable, such as `{id}` in `GetRoute(\"/{id}\")`. A path variable is a part of the URL that can change, such as an ID. `FromPath` puts its value into the method parameter with the same name. The parameter type is checked first. When `id` is a number, `/items/abc` gets 400. On the Tac side, a page folder whose name starts with an underscore, such as `client/pages/items/_id/`, matches any value.",
